Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(food):=20frequent=20meals=20=E2=80=94=20ke?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ep=20a=20meal,=20log=20it=20again=20with=20one=20tap?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A meal eaten every day (the same breakfast) no longer needs a photo: the
review sheet offers to keep its foods as a frequent meal, and the Food tab
shows those as chips. A tap logs the meal now on the clock's day and meal,
editable or deletable like any other; a long press drops the chip. Stored
in the food log JSON beside the meals (older logs read without it).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
